}
```

```exsecutor
typus Color = casus ruber, casus viridis, casus caeruleus;

publica functio index(c: Color) -> u8 {
    discerne c {
        casus ruber     { redde 0; }
        casus viridis   { redde 1; }
        casus caeruleus { redde 2; }
    }
}
```

A sum type is a `typus` whose body is a comma-separated list of `casus` variants, and the same keyword `casus` introduces each arm of the `discerne`. A sum scrutinee is exhaustive by naming every variant, so no `aliter` is needed here; leave a variant out and the compiler answers EXS-E0351 and lists the missing arms in declaration order.

